{"strongs": "H4205", "word": "מָזוֺר", "translit": "ma.zor", "root": "מזור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "wound", "definition": "מָזוֺר noun [masculine] wound (as needing to have its matter pressed out ) — figurative of injury to, or sufferings of, Israel and Judah: מָזוֺר Hos 5:13 also Jer 30:13 ( Gf Che RVm ; but accents Ew Ges Gie AV RV for pressing , i.e. binding up); מְזֹרוֺ Hos 5:13 (compare III. זור Isa 1:6 ). — מָזוֺר Obad 1:7 see below מזר . זָזָא see below זוז .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2332')\">BDB2332</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4205')\">H4205</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2331')\">BDB2331</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2333')\">BDB2333</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מָזוֺר</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>wound</highlightword> (as needing to have its matter <highlight>pressed out</highlight>) — figurative of injury to, or sufferings of, Israel and Judah: <bdbheb>מָזוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 5:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,13)\">Hos 5:13</ref> also <ref ref=\"Jer 30:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,13)\">Jer 30:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RVm</reflink></lookup>; but accents <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <highlight>for pressing</highlight>, i.e. binding up); <bdbheb>מְזֹרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 5:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,13)\">Hos 5:13</ref> (compare III. <bdbheb>זור</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,6)\">Isa 1:6</ref>). — <bdbheb>מָזוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Obad 1:7\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,7)\">Obad 1:7</ref> see below <bdbheb>מזר</bdbheb>. </p><hr><p> <bdbheb>זָזָא</bdbheb> see below <bdbheb>זוז</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hos 5:13", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 5, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Jer 30:13", "book": "JER", "chapter": 30, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 1:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Obad 1:7", "book": "OBA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 7}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מָזוֺר", "מְזֹרוֺ", "זור", "מזר", "זָזָא", "זוז"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["AV", "Che", "Ew", "Ges", "Gf", "Gie", "RV"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB2332", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}